    "norm": "Tests that converting an AccountingDate to a LocalDate (ISO) produces the correct result. The chronology under test ends on SUNDAY nearest the end of AUGUST, divides the year into THIRTEEN_EVEN_MONTHS_OF_4_WEEKS, and places the leap week in month 13."
   },
